{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>COLLAR成員Gao與美女廚師Kit Mak在ViuTV節目《港出好味道》第7集，遠赴英國拜訪3位開設冰鮮湯 …</p><p></p>\n<p>COLLAR成員Gao與美女廚師Kit Mak在ViuTV節目《港出好味道》第7集，遠赴英國拜訪3位開設冰鮮湯麵工廠的移英港人。3位老闆初期面臨物流配送延誤及繁複工序等嚴峻挑戰，幾乎令整盤生意陷入絕境。他們最終憑藉破格的自營物流與全人手製作，逆轉了這個看似無解的難關。之後Kit和Gao更會合Ivy，到「曼城葵廣」掃街，Gao與Ivy大啖港人燒味店的招牌燒鵝髀！</p>\n<h2>《港出好味道》Gao與Kit赴英國工廠遇震撼畫面</h2>\n<p>節目中Gao與Kit親身走入這間位於英國Warrington的食品工廠，直擊3人全人手處理湯底及麵條包裝的生產流程。2位主持獲安排即場自選湯底與配料，Kit貪心加料更被店主笑指湯麵似盆菜，場面相當震撼。Gao在簡單翻熱品嚐後，大讚食物質素極高。</p>\n<h2>創辦人Herbert親述逆境求生全人手製作保證品質</h2>\n<p>面對創業初期的種種難關，創辦人之一Herbert在受訪時道出決心：「我們開始之前都知道會有這段時間需要經歷。」工廠曾遇上物流配送不穩定導致食材保鮮期受影響，甚至試過運送延誤超過10小時。3人其後決定改由自行車隊配送解決保鮮危機，並堅持採用全人手製作以確保每碗湯麵品質一致，成功令產品打入英國當地超級市場及農場商店。</p>\n<h2>3位移英港人因相同價值觀合作創業</h2>\n<p>Herbert、Anson和Michael這3位飲食業門外漢原本在香港只有1次相遇的緣份，當時僅在同住大廈偶然遇見並談論過單車話題。直至移居英國後，他們發覺彼此在人生目標及家庭觀念上擁有極度相近的標準，於是一拍即合決定合夥創業。由初期只生產肉丸，慢慢改良至推出包含湯底與配料並方便快捷的翻熱包裝，最終成功研發出多款切合不同顧客口味的冰鮮湯麵。之後Kit和Gao更會合Ivy，到「曼城葵廣」掃街。老闆們見到三人到來，即場斬燒鵝髀給她們試食。Gao與Ivy試完都忍不住手舞足蹈：「好好味啊！好開心啊！」並表示回到香港一定會再去位於元朗的分店！</p>\n<h2>觀眾激讚Gao與Ivy豪邁食相 力撐港人拼搏精神</h2>\n<p>節目播出後引發大批網民熱烈討論，不少觀眾對於3位老闆在異鄉堅持不懈大感敬佩。有網民在社交平台留言表示：「這幾位老闆展現出真正的香港人拼搏精神！」亦有大批粉絲將焦點放在主持身上，直指Gao與Ivy試食時興奮到跳舞的反應極度可愛，紛紛於各大討論區留下正面評價。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433898832118752_11830702576af370acd26a8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar Gao和Kit即場自選湯底與豐富配料，Kit貪心加料被笑指湯麵似盆菜。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433898832118752_11830702576af370acd26a8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Gao和Kit即場自選湯底與豐富配料，Kit貪心加料被笑指湯麵似盆菜。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943389903462274_5066151576af370aeda9fe.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar 3位老闆原本在香港僅有一面之緣因單車話題結緣，移居英國後一拍即合創業。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943389903462274_5066151576af370aeda9fe.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>3位老闆原本在香港僅有一面之緣因單車話題結緣，移居英國後一拍即合創業。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943389965608358_1949342926af370b4eb438.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar Ivy前往曼城葵廣掃街，即場品嚐燒鵝髀。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943389965608358_1949342926af370b4eb438.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy前往曼城葵廣掃街，即場品嚐燒鵝髀。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433900328917930_7284207086af370bbaa529.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar Gao大讚好味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433900328917930_7284207086af370bbaa529.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Gao大讚好味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433900959540851_10671443106af370c21e33d.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar Ivy和Gao曼城葵廣掃街，大讚質素極高，完美還原正宗香港風味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433900959540851_10671443106af370c21e33d.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy和Gao曼城葵廣掃街，大讚質素極高，完美還原正宗香港風味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433901615124181_11853250006af370c884041.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar COLLAR成員Gao與Kit遠赴英國Warrington，親身拜訪開設冰鮮湯麵工廠的移英港人。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433901615124181_11853250006af370c884041.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>COLLAR成員Gao與Kit遠赴英國Warrington，親身拜訪開設冰鮮湯麵工廠的移英港人。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433901796694772_6526630466af370ca4db65.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar 工廠內部直擊3人全人手處理湯底及麵條包裝，確保產品品質與口感。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433901796694772_6526630466af370ca4db65.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>工廠內部直擊3人全人手處理湯底及麵條包裝，確保產品品質與口感。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433901948929219_4761418916af370cc7bb34.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar Kit、Ivy和Gao大啖出爐燒鵝髀，大飽口福。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433901948929219_4761418916af370cc7bb34.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Kit、Ivy和Gao大啖出爐燒鵝髀，大飽口福。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/collar/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">COLLAR</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%86%b0%e9%ae%ae%e6%b9%af%e9%ba%b5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">冰鮮湯麵</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b8%af%e5%87%ba%e5%a5%bd%e5%91%b3%e9%81%93/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">港出好味道</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：ViuTV資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3540032\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a%e8%a9%b1%e9%a1%8c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">旅遊話題</a>\nNov 11 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:51:42.995688+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1418,"images":8,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T03:30:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T04:46:04.221101+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T03:45:21.100553+00:00","content_hash":"dc89cb39ceda6d2f1c6fa109c0dd01c8ac1ae6c3894993579f1bde5ce104618e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}